  "description": "Is blacking out always this scary? Imagine blacking out and waking up in a different world! A teacher finds herself in the body of lady Lucia, a woman who committed suicide. While trying to understand what happened, she realizes Lucia was actually murdered. Why does the emperor hide behind a mask? And what really happened to Lucia...?\n(Source: Copin Comics)",
